      "finding": "Waxing illumination is on the right and waning on the left in crescent and half cases; gibbous terminators are on the complementary side. Near-new 0.01 remains a dark disc with the corresponding thin lit edge. Full 1.0 has the same material orientation for both senses. No obvious phase/sense-label swap was observed.",
