      "finding": "Initial and pinned-full discs occupy the same visible size and position within each pair. DPR1 individual images are 115x115, DPR2 are 230x230; the nominal diameters are approximately 104.1408 and 208.2816 device pixels. The paired subpixel-shift cases show no obvious rescale, crop or centering swap.",
